<title>ITALY: Italy industry minister to meet new Olivetti CEO.</title>
<headline>Italy industry minister to meet new Olivetti CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industry minister Pier Luigi Bersani said on Thursday he would meet new Olivetti chief executive Roberto Colaninno soon.</p>
<p>&quot;There is the intention to resolve the problems. We will soon meet the new chief executive,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>Colaninno, a close ally of former chairman Carlo De Benedetti, was appointed late on Wednesday after the ousting of Francesco Caio who lasted only three months in the job.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
